  "definition": "Description of Actuarial Memorandum Including an Asset Adequacy Analysis and Regulatory Asset Adequacy Issues Summary",
  "effectiveDate": "2019-04-01",
  "historyNote": "#6635, eff 11-24-97; ss by #8484, eff 11-24-05; ss by #9892, eff 4-1-11; ss by #9892, eff 4-1-11; ss by #12705, eff 4-1-19",
